# Verification

- Never claim completion without running relevant checks.
- Base gate: lint + typecheck + unit/integration + production build.
- Security features require adversarial integration tests through real code paths.
- UI features require Playwright desktop/mobile for critical flows.
- A mocked `requireAuth` cannot prove auth security.
- No unsigned JWT helper.
- Report results as PASS, FAIL or EXTERNAL_BLOCKED with evidence and exact missing external configuration.
- Use verifier subagent after implementation before declaring a phase complete.

- Add contract regression that Session/Core/Supervisor safety severity enums are identical (`none|attention|urgent_review`).
- Test public_code concurrency, secretary finance none/view/manage RLS, capture-grant/fallback-consent denial and no-audio-egress on the local transcription path, Meet pending/success/failure, and overlapping reminder jobs.
